  "_comment": "VTID-05157 — scope and lane rules for the native parity ledger (apps/mobile/parity/ledger.json), applied by scripts/native/parity-ledger.mjs. Scope order: `paths` (exact web path) > `scope_prefixes` > `registry_access` > pending. Lane order: `paths[].lane` > `lane_rules` (longest prefix) > `lane_by_category`. Anything unmatched is `pending` and fails --check until it is decided here. Program: docs/programs/native-app/NATIVE-APP-PLAN.md §2 decision 3 (scope), §5 Wave 2 (lanes).",
